#: ../../source/index.md:1
msgid "CNETA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:3
msgid ""
"CNETA is a suite of tools for analysing copy-number evolution in tumour "
"samples. It comprises three command-line programs:"
msgstr "CNETA 是一套分析肿瘤样本拷贝数演化的工具，包含三个命令行程序："

#: ../../source/index.md:6
msgid "`cnets`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:7
msgid "simulation of copy-number evolution."
msgstr "模拟拷贝数演化。"

#: ../../source/index.md:9
msgid "`cnetml`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:10
msgid "maximum-likelihood phylogenetic inference."
msgstr "最大似然系统发育推断。"

#: ../../source/index.md:12
msgid "`cnetmcmc`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/index.md:13
msgid "Bayesian (MCMC) phylogenetic inference."
msgstr "贝叶斯（MCMC）系统发育推断。"

#: ../../source/index.md:15
msgid ""
"This is version 2 of CNETA ([lu-cbio-group/cneta2](https://github.com/lu-"
"cbio-group/cneta2)); the first version is at [ucl-"
"cssb/cneta](https://github.com/ucl-cssb/cneta)."
msgstr ""
"这是 CNETA 第 2 版（[lu-cbio-group/cneta2](https://github.com/lu-cbio-"
"group/cneta2)）；第 1 版见 [ucl-cssb/cneta](https://github.com/ucl-cssb/cneta)。"

#: ../../source/index.md:20
msgid ""
"This documentation is under active development alongside the software. "
"Sections marked **TODO** are placeholders awaiting content."
msgstr "本文档随软件一起持续开发中。标有 **TODO** 的部分是待补充内容的占位。"

#: ../../source/index.md:24
msgid "Where to start"
msgstr "从哪里开始"

#: ../../source/index.md:26
msgid ""
"New to CNETA? Start with [Installation](installation/index.md), then the "
"[Quick start](quickstart/index.md)."
msgstr "第一次使用 CNETA？先看[安装](installation/index.md)，再看[快速上手](quickstart/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/index.md:28
msgid "Chaining the tools together? See [Workflows](workflows/index.md)."
msgstr "要把几个工具串起来用？见[工作流程](workflows/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/index.md:29
msgid "Contributing code? See the [Developer docs](developer-guide/index.md)."
msgstr "要贡献代码？见[开发者文档](developer-guide/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/index.md:31
msgid "Project status"
msgstr "项目状态"

#: ../../source/index.md:33
msgid ""
"`cnets` and `cnetml` are the mature, published tools; `cnetmcmc` is under "
"active development and not yet comprehensively tested. This documentation "
"tracks CNETA version 2.0."
msgstr "`cnets` 和 `cnetml` 是成熟、已发表的工具；`cnetmcmc` 仍在开发中，尚未经过全面测试。本文档对应 CNETA 2.0 版。"

